  "dcterms:title": "ANC.DT.16 Dietary counselling",
  "dcterms:description": "ALL women should have \"Healthy eating and keeping physically active counselling\" with guidance on nutrition and exercise. If a woman is classified as \"underweight\" AND she is part of a population whereby the prevalence of undernourishment is greater than or equal to 20%, then additional dietary counselling is needed.",
